      "severity": "Important",
      "corroboration_count": 4,
      "description": "docs/external/release-notes.md has no entry for this change. The first '## Unreleased' section, directly below the October 28, 2026 entry, mentions neither save_text_memories nor the agent no longer saving free-form notes. Acceptance criterion four requires an entry there stating the agent no longer saves free-form notes unless save_text_memories = true, marking it a behavior change for existing deployments, telling TOML and environment-variable operators to set save_text_memories = true to keep the old behavior, telling MCPB users to tick the new checkbox, and explaining that earlier notes stay in memory and are still used, that an agent-written note cannot be told apart from an imported one, that TOML and environment operators can review and delete wrong notes with the memory-administration tools, linking the 'Memory-Administration Tools for the Assistant' section of docs/external/managing-memory.md, and that an MCPB install's settings cannot turn those tools on.",
      "capped_by_4_1_5": true,
      "capped_grade": "important",
