      "kind": "test_gap",
      "severity": "Suggestion",
      "corroboration_count": 1,
      "description": "No test composes the environment-variable arm of acceptance criterion three end to end. tests/unit/test_config_schema.py lines 317 to 322 prove the environment variable sets the field and tests/unit/test_factory_wiring.py lines 479 to 491 prove a true field registers the tool, but nothing runs Config.load under SQLLENS_MEMORY__SAVE_TEXT_MEMORIES and then build_agent. The gate reads cfg.memory.save_text_memories directly, so the escape risk is low.",
